[statement]
A `!` dependency forbids a package providing the name it states, as well
as one carrying it.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:!y

P:p1
V:1
p:y=1

[request]
app
p1

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   p1-1:
|     breaks: app-1[!y]
|     satisfies: world[p1]
refused
